    <section id="full-service-supply-capability" class="sectionBox capability_section">
        <div class="section1">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row justify-content-end">
                    <div class="col-lg-9">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-lg-12">
                                <div class="heading40_black mb-3 " data-aos="zoom-in">FULL SERVICE SUPPLY CAPABILITY
                                </div>
                                <div class="capability_sectionBox" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                    <div class="heading31_black mb-3">From concept to creation, we provide everything you need, all in one place—your complete supply solution.</div>
                                    <p>Bharat Forge has always looked upon itself as an engineering company with best-in-class problem-solving skills. We continuously engage with our customers to identify white spaces and propose solutions to alleviate their predicaments. We believe that continuous dialogue and knowledge exchange with customers are key to growth. </p>
                                    <p>Preferred as a technology and engineering-driven development partner across various sectors, we offer vertical integration with end-to-end capabilities, from steel to finished components and aggregates.</p>
                                    <p>Our ability to take on complex assignments and deliver them right the first time has helped us earn the trust and goodwill of our customers. We have always invested ahead of time and created the right mix of capacities, giving our customers ample confidence in our ability to deliver on time.</p>
                                    <p>With our Full Service Supply Capability, we have ventured into multiple new product zones which are highly advanced in nature and require specialized skills.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="img_wrap py-3 mb-0" data-aos="zoom-in">

                                    <img src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/Full_Service_supplier-(1).png" alt=""
                                        class="img-fluid">
                                    <!--<img src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/full_services_infographics.jpg" alt=""-->
                                    <!--    class="img-fluid">-->
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
