                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_title">We are proud to announce that Bharat Forge Ltd. has been honoured with the Gold Award for Excellence in R&D in the Engineering & Manufacturing category at the prestigious CII R&D Excellence Awards 2026.</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>This recognition reflects our unwavering commitment to innovation, research, and technological excellence. It celebrates our ability to transform research and ideas into innovative products, processes, and technologies that are shaping the future of manufacturing.</p>
