                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_title"> Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director, Bharat Forge Limited, has been conferred with the prestigious Arjan Vaswani #Founders_Leadership Award 2025</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>We are proud to share that Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director, Bharat Forge Limited, has been conferred with the prestigious Arjan Vaswani #Founders_Leadership Award 2025 at the 73rd Indian Foundry Congress & #IFEX 2025 in Kolkata. Instituted in the 75th year of the Institute of Indian Foundrymen, this award honors his visionary leadership and transformative contributions, positioning India on the global map of the foundry and forging industry. 
</p>
                                                            </div>
