"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director, Bharat Forge Ltd., has been honored as the “Industry Science Leader 2025” by FAST India</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>We are proud to share that Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director, Bharat Forge Ltd., has been honored as the “Industry Science Leader 2025” by FAST India at the India Science Fest 2025, held on January 11th at Fergusson College, Pune.
This recognition reflects Mr. Kalyani's visionary leadership in driving innovation, technological excellence, and sustainable industrial growth.</p>
                                                            </div>
