                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_title">Bharat Forge received a BHEL award for developing alloy and carbon steel nozzles for 700MW Nuclear Reactor steam generators.</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>We are proud to announce that Bharat Forge has been awarded by Bharat Heavy Electricals Ltd. (BHEL) for developing alloy and carbon steel nozzles for steam generators used in 700MW Nuclear Reactors. This remarkable achievement, recognized by Mr. H.D. Kumarswamy, Minister for Steel and Heavy Industries, on November 25th, marks a significant milestone in India’s engineering landscape. These forgings are not only import substitutions but also the first of their kind developed in India!</p>
