                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_title">Bharat Forge Receives ESG Award from Ashok Leyland, Affirming Commitment to Sustainability and ESG Excellence</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>We are honored to share that Ashok Leyland has recently conferred the ESG Award to Bharat Forge. This prestigious recognition underscores our strategic commitment to sustainability and our unwavering focus on ESG compliance. As we advance, we are dedicated to leading the charge in ESG excellence and aim to set new benchmarks by 2030. Our journey towards a sustainable future is a strategic priority, and we thank Ashok Leyland for believing in Bharat Forge as a trusted partner in achieving success and contributing in building a #ViksitBharat2047.</p>
