                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <!--<div class="award_date">2024</div>-->
                                                            <div class="award_title">Rural Development category at the CSR Times Awards 2024!</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>We are thrilled to share that Bharat Forge has been awarded the Gold Award in the Rural 
                                                                Development category at the CSR Times Awards 2024! The honor was presented by Dr. Pramod Sawant, 
                                                                the Chief Minister of Goa, at a distinguished ceremony held at Raj Bhawan's Darbar Hall. 
                                                                This accolade celebrates our unwavering commitment to driving sustainable and inclusive 
                                                                growth in rural communities through impactful CSR initiatives. From enhancing education and 
                                                                healthcare to improving sanitation and fostering entrepreneurship, Bharat Forge is dedicated
                                                                to making a meaningful difference. As Mr. Baba Kalyani, CMD Bharat Forge, shared, 
                                                                “This award is a testament to our commitment to uplifting rural communities. 
                                                                We remain focused on creating long-term social impact and driving positive change.</p>
                                                            </div>
