                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <!--<div class="award_date">June 2024</div>-->
                                                            <div class="award_title">ZF Wind Power has proudly awarded Bharat Forge’s Awards 2024!</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>ZF Wind Power has proudly awarded Bharat Forge’s <a href="https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/ringrolling" target="_blank" style="color: #Ee7853;">RingRolling</a> team for their exceptional contribution to the <a href="https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/valueanalysis" target="_blank" style="color: #Ee7853;">Value Analysis/#Value Engineering (#VAVE)</a> workshop. This recognition highlights the team's dedication and innovative efforts in driving value and efficiency in our projects. Congratulations to the entire team for this well-deserved honor!</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
