                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/kargil.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <!--<div class="award_date">AUG 2024</div>-->
                                                            <div class="award_title">At Kargil Honours Awards 2024!</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>At Kargil Honours 2024, Mr. Babasaheb N. Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director, Bharat Forge Ltd. paid tribute to our Kargil heroes and highlighted Bharat Forge’s pivotal role in 1999. Reflecting on the Kargil War’s 25th anniversary, he celebrated India’s strides in defence manufacturing, driven by <a href="https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/makeinindia" target="_blank">Makein India</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/atmanirbharbharat" target="_blank">Atmanirbhar Bharat</a> initiatives. We are delighted to share that Mr. Babasaheb N. Kalyani, received the recognition for Bharat Forge’s support to Armed Forces to meet the emergent requirement during the Kargil War. This underscores our unwavering commitment to India’s defense. With pride, we continue to forge for a Viksit Bharat. Watch this video to know more.</p>

                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
