                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_title">Bharat Forge Aerospace Division is awarded the Supplier Excellence Award 2024!</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge Aerospace Division is awarded the Supplier Excellence Award as Growth Champion at the Honeywell India Supplier Summit 2024 in Bengaluru last week. Our commitment to innovation and excellence shines through with the development of innovative technology products for Honeywell. Our partnership with Honeywell has strengthened the relationship and opened new avenues for growth.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/prestigious_IGBC.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_title">Bharat Forge Ltd. has been awarded the prestigious IGBC Green Village rating.</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>We are delighted to announce that six of our villages, where we have been actively involved as part of our CSR initiative, have received the prestigious IGBC Green Village rating!</p>
                                                                <p>Throughout the assessment process, 32 indicators across seven modules were meticulously evaluated. From water conservation to village infrastructure, health, and hygiene, each aspect played a crucial role.</p>
                                                                <p>Village Dhamner has achieved a Platinum rating, symbolizing our global leadership in sustainable practices. Villages like Saygaon, Takale, Nagzari, and Rui have been awarded Gold ratings, highlighting our commitment
                                                                to national excellence. Additionally, the village of Targaon has earned a Silver rating, showcasing our dedication to best practices.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/FTAsia-Pacific.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <!--<div class="award_date">AUG 2024</div>-->
                                                            <div class="award_title">Bharat Forge has been recognized as one of the FT Asia-Pacific Climate Leaders Award 2024</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge has been recognized as one of the FT Asia-Pacific Climate Leaders 2024 by Financial Times and Statista for the second consecutive year. This prestigious accolade fills us with immense pride as we champion transparency, achieve year-over-year reductions in core emissions, and collaborate with CDP and the Science Based Targets initiative. Our unwavering commitment to net-zero is guiding us on our journey towards a more sustainable future under our Planet Positive initiative. Together, we are forging a path to a greener, more eco-friendly world. We extend our heartfelt gratitude to all our employees for their tireless efforts and dedication in making this achievement possible.</p>
                                                                <!--<p>Village Dhamner has achieved a Platinum rating, symbolizing our global leadership in sustainable practices. Villages like Saygaon, Takale, Nagzari, and Rui have been awarded Gold ratings, highlighting our commitment to national excellence. Additionally, the village of Targaon has earned a Silver rating, showcasing our dedication to best practices.</p>-->
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                   

                                                    
