                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">APRIL, 2024</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Bharat Forge Ltd. has been awarded
                                                                the prestigious IGBC Green Village rating.</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>We are delighted to announce that six of our
                                                                    villages, where we have been actively involved as
                                                                    part of our CSR initiative, have received the
                                                                    prestigious IGBC Green Village rating! Throughout
                                                                    the assessment process, 32 indicators across seven
                                                                    modules were meticulously evaluated. From water
                                                                    conservation to village infrastructure, health, and
                                                                    hygiene, each aspect played a crucial role.</p>
                                                                <p>Village Dhamner has achieved a Platinum rating,
                                                                    symbolizing our global leadership in sustainable
                                                                    practices. Villages like Saygaon, Takale, Nagzari,
                                                                    and Rui have been awarded Gold ratings, highlighting
