                                                                <p>The “Fellowship Award” of the National Institute of
                                                                    Personnel Management (NIPM) was conferred upon Dr.
                                                                    S.V. Bhave, Senior VP - HR, IR & Admin, Bharat
                                                                    Forge.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was ceremonially conferred upon him at the
                                                                    NIPM Evening & Convocation of 34th Annual National
                                                                    Conference of NIPM held on October 8, 2015 at
                                                                    Coimbatore. This award is given to senior HR
                                                                    Professionals on all India basis for rendering
