                                                                Director, Bharat Forge conferred with the prestigious
                                                                "The Machinist Super Next Generation Leader Award-2015"
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                Mr. Amit Kalyani, Executive Director, Bharat Forge
                                                                Limited was conferred with the prestigious “The
                                                                Machinist Super Next Generation Leader Award -2015” for
                                                                his outstanding contribution in the field of Business
                                                                Industry and recognition of his successful journey as a
                                                                next generation entrepreneur as well as in recognition
                                                                of his dynamic contribution to the growth of the
                                                                company. Hon’ble Union Minister of Micro, Small & Medium
                                                                Enterprises, Shri Kalraj Mishra honored Mr. Amit Kalyani
