                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">23<sup>TH</sup> APRIL 2015</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Bharat forge awarded Best Pavilion
                                                                in the Large Enterprise Category at Hannover Messe 2015
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was awarded the best Pavilion in the
                                                                    “Large Enterprise Category” at Make in India at
                                                                    Hannover Messe 2015. Hannover Messe 2015, the
                                                                    world’s leading trade fair for industrial
                                                                    technologies was held in Hannover, Germany in April
                                                                    2015 and India was the partner country. Bharat Forge
                                                                    booth at the Hannover Messe Industrial Trade Fair
                                                                    was visited by Hon’ble Prime Minister of India, Shri
                                                                    Narendra Modi and German Chancellor, Angela Merkel.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p>The association was seen as an important step in
                                                                    furthering Indo – German ties and reflected the
                                                                    renewed global confidence in the country. It also
                                                                    highlighted Prime Minister Narendra Modi’s ambitious
                                                                    ‘Make in India’ project on a global platform.</p>

