                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox listScroll">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">14<sup>TH</sup> NOVEMBER 2014</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge conferred with the
                                                                prestigious "IIM - JRD Tata Award for Excellence in
                                                                Corporate Leadership in Metallurgical Industries-2014"
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Baba Kalyani, Chairman and Managing Director, Bharat
                                                                    Forge was conferred with the prestigious “IIM-JRD
                                                                    Tata Award for Excellence in Corporate Leadership in
                                                                    Metallurgical industries – 2014” for his outstanding
                                                                    contribution in the field of Metallurgical
                                                                    industries and Manufacturing sector. On the occasion
                                                                    of 68th Annual Technical Meeting of The Indian
                                                                    Institute of Metals, Shri Narendra Singh Tomar,
                                                                    Union Minister of Steel & Mines honored Mr. Baba
                                                                    Kalyani with this award. The award ceremony was
                                                                    organized at the College of Engineering, Pune on
                                                                    Friday, 14th November 2014.</p>
                                                                <p>Since 2008, each year the National Council of The
                                                                    Indian Institute of Metals selects one eminent
                                                                    public figure for conferring this award. Eminent
                                                                    personalities like Shri Ratan Tata, Shri B
                                                                    Muthurmanan , Former Vice Chairman Tata Steel, Dr E
                                                                    Sreedharan , Former MD, Delhi Metro, Debnarayan
                                                                    Bhattacharya, MD, Hindalco Industries , Dr Sanak
                                                                    Mishra, Vice President, Arcelor Mittal and HM
                                                                    Nerurkar, Former MD, Tata Steel have been previously
                                                                    awarded with this honour.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">20<sup>TH</sup> SEPTEMBER 2014</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge conferred with the
                                                                prestigious 'Sir M Visvesvaraya Memorial Award - 2014'
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge was conferred with the “Bharatratna Sir
                                                                    M Visvesvaraya Memorial Award – 2014” by the
                                                                    Federation of Karnataka Chambers of Commerce &
                                                                    Industry at a function organized in Bengaluru, on
                                                                    the occasion of Founder’s Day Celebrations. Marking
                                                                    the occasion were Shri D V Sadananda Gowda, Hon’ble
                                                                    Union Minister for Railways; Dr. Narendra Jadhav,
                                                                    Former Member of the Planning Commission of India;
                                                                    Shri S. Sampathraman, President, FKCCI and many
                                                                    other distinguished leaders from the business
                                                                    community, members of the chambers, academicians,
                                                                    economists, legislators and policy makers.</p>
                                                                <p>Commemorating the birth anniversary of Sir M
                                                                    Visvesvaraya, Federation of Karnataka Chambers of
                                                                    Commerce & Industry instituted the Visvesvaraya
                                                                    Memorial Award in the year 1999 to recognize and
                                                                    acknowledge the outstanding efforts of distinguished
                                                                    persons who have significantly contributed to the
                                                                    economic and social development of India and the
                                                                    state of Karnataka. Mr. NR Narayana Murthy, Mr. Azim
                                                                    H Premji, Dr Devi Shetty are some of the eminent
                                                                    past recipients of this award.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">06<sup>TH</sup> JUNE 2014</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">‘Rail Business - Product of the
                                                                Year</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge won the prestigious ‘Rail Business –
                                                                    Product of the Year Award-2014’ for making
                                                                    significant progress in design and implementation.
                                                                    The award ceremony was held by Rail Business
                                                                    Magazine on Friday, 6th June 2014 at SER Railway
                                                                    Officer’s Club, Garden Reach in Kolkata. The award
                                                                    was received by V.K. Jain, Advisor, Bharat Forge
                                                                    presented by Chairman, Railway Board Mr. Arunendra
                                                                    Kumar.</p>
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge has been supplying to all major railway
                                                                    networks across the world Including US and Europe.
                                                                    Bharat Forge supplies critical engine components
                                                                    such as large crankshafts and connecting rods to the
                                                                    railway industry globally and is the only Crankshaft
                                                                    Manufacturer in India for the industrial sector.</p>

                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox listScroll">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">29<sup>TH</sup> NOVEMBER 2013</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">"Sword of Honour Award" For Safety
                                                                Success</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was conferred upon with the prestigious
                                                                    international “Sword of Honour Award” by the British
                                                                    Safety Council for our Health & Safety Management
                                                                    Systems.</p>
                                                                <p>The Sword of Honour Award was received by Mr. B P
                                                                    Kalyani, Executive Director, Bharat Forge today,
                                                                    29th November 2013 at the historic Goldsmiths’ Hall
                                                                    in the City of London</p>
                                                                <p>The Sword of Honour is a reflection of high standards
                                                                    of Health & Safety performance and demonstration of
                                                                    leadership in safety in all phases of operations
                                                                    across the plant. Bharat Forge Limited is among a
                                                                    few companies in the world in the forging sector to
                                                                    have received this honour.</p>
                                                                <p>Accepting the Award, Mr B P Kalyani, Executive
                                                                    Director, Bharat Forge Ltd., said “I would like to
                                                                    thank the British Safety Council for recognizing our
                                                                    efforts towards Health & Safety and honouring us
                                                                    with the Sword”. I would also like to congratulate
                                                                    our entire team for this outstanding achievement and
                                                                    am sure that we continue working with the same zeal
                                                                    and spirit in the area of Health, Safety and
                                                                    Environment, he added.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">28<sup>TH</sup> NOVEMBER 2013</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">'Five Star Rating' by The British
                                                                Safety Council,UK.</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge has been awarded the 'Five Star Rating'
                                                                    by The British Safety Council, UK. The award aims to
                                                                    recognise the 'best of the best' in health and
                                                                    safety management.</p>
                                                                <p>The international "quality-assured rating" system
                                                                    evaluates an organisation's health, safety and
                                                                    performance. A structured audit system provides a
                                                                    safety plan for continuous improvement towards best
                                                                    practice.</p>
                                                                <p>To ensure it is a truly objective measurement and
                                                                    continuous improvement tool, the Five Star protocol
                                                                    and methodology evaluates management performance
                                                                    quantitatively, producing a numerical score for each
                                                                    of the 60 elements. The report works from a zero
                                                                    base and builds on an organisation's success in each
                                                                    element. It also highlights successes and
                                                                    opportunities.</p>
                                                                <p>The British Safety Council's five star rating for
                                                                    Health and Safety management system audit is a
                                                                    comprehensive audit system that is designed for
                                                                    'real' workplace. It is a demonstration of good
                                                                    health and safety practice in the facility.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">28<sup>TH</sup>NOVEMBER 2013</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Zope,Group CIO Awarded As
                                                                'Great CISO’s Of India'</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge Group CIO, Yogesh Zope have been awarded
                                                                    Great CIO's of India. We interacted with him and
                                                                    found out what makes him the great CIO of India.</p>
                                                                <p>Your Achievements as a CISO</p>
                                                                <ul>
                                                                    <li>I have established a security process to go with
                                                                        well-designed technical architecture with
                                                                        Kalyani Group, long back we achieved ISO 270001
                                                                        certification and we are matured company when it
                                                                        comes to security awareness. Recently we
                                                                        deployed multi-layered security solution for a
                                                                        multi tenanted Data Center of Kalyani Group.
                                                                        This was large project implementation
                                                                        best-of-breed security technologies.</li>
                                                                    <li> A technology that will see more adaption in
                                                                        securing networks According to me DLP in
                                                                        combination with Encryption will see more
                                                                        adoptions. BYOD requires Mobile Management to
                                                                        address related threats. Centralized log
                                                                        analysis will help in monitoring and managing
                                                                        networks.</li>
                                                                    <li>A network threat that CISOs should give more
                                                                        attention to Internal threats to the data and
                                                                        balance between People, Process & Technology
                                                                        need more attention from CISOs.</li>
                                                                    <li>The best security architecture to protect
                                                                        enterprise networks. We refer to IT Risk Pyramid
                                                                        model development by Westerman and R Hunter in
                                                                        which they found the risk factor related to
                                                                        availability, access, accuracy and the model
                                                                        architecture must consider these risk. The
                                                                        architecture should also deploy controls without
                                                                        affecting performance (both technology &User).
                                                                    </li>
                                                                    <li>Your message to cybercriminals Why this fight?
                                                                        Let’s make a world better to Live.</li>
                                                                </ul>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">22<sup>TH</sup>OCTOBER 2013</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge confered with the
                                                                "Lakshya Business Visionary Award"</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>In recognition of his extraordinary contribution to
                                                                    the Indian business landscape, Mr. Baba Kalyani,
                                                                    Chairman and Managing Director, Bharat Forge was
                                                                    today, conferred with the prestigious ‘Lakshya
                                                                    Business Visionary Award’ by the National Institute
                                                                    of Industrial Engineering (NITIE). In an acceptance
                                                                    speech that was read out at the function, Mr.
                                                                    Kalyani said, ”I am extremely thankful to the
                                                                    National Institute of Industrial Engineering
                                                                    (NITIE), for bestowing this honour upon me. Such
                                                                    honours have been a constant source of inspiration
                                                                    for me and my company”.</p>
                                                                <p>At Bharat Forge, we have always envisioned a
                                                                    borderless world, where deep-rooted innovation and
                                                                    entrepreneurship can achieve its full potential.
                                                                    Since inception, across decades, we have channelized
                                                                    our passion, intellect and energy towards achieving
                                                                    this objective. The Lakshya Business Visionary award
                                                                    further exemplifies our collective achievement of
                                                                    this objective.</p>
                                                                <p>Going forward, we will continue to create value on
                                                                    the strength of our vision, and entrepreneurial
                                                                    spirit to not only enhance our global manufacturing
                                                                    footprint but also promote and signify the Triumph
                                                                    of BRAND INDIA, he added.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">28<sup>TH</sup>SEPTEMBER 2013</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Manufacturing Today's - "Excellence
                                                                in Technology Award 2013"</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was conferred with the prestigious
                                                                    'Manufacturing Today's Excellence in Technology
                                                                    Award 2013' at Pune on Saturday, 28th September 2013
                                                                    at Hyatt Pune. The Excellence award refers to
                                                                    enhanced competitiveness and efficiency by adoption
                                                                    of technologies including machinery, equipment,
                                                                    industrial automation, robotics, ERP and so on.</p>
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was nominated for the award due to its
                                                                    significant progress in design & implementation. It
                                                                    has been able to successfully operate in a
                                                                    technology driven infrastructure and has shown
                                                                    commendable return on investment. The award was
                                                                    presented at a specially organized 'Awards
                                                                    Presentation Ceremony' in the presence of
                                                                    distinguished gathering of business leaders,
                                                                    jurists, academics, environmentalists, economists,
                                                                    legislators and policy makers.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">19<sup>TH</sup>JULY 2013</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge conferred with the "IOD
                                                                distinguished fellowship award 2013"</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman and Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge, was conferred with the "IOD
                                                                    Distinguished Fellowship Award 2013".The award was
                                                                    presented by Dr. M Veerappa Moily, Union Minister
                                                                    for Petroleum & Natural Gas on Friday, 19th July
                                                                    2013 at Ashok Hotel, Chanakyapuri, New Delhi in the
                                                                    presence of a distinguished international gathering
                                                                    of business leaders, experts, jurists, economists,
                                                                    legislators and policy makers on the occasion of
                                                                    IOD's 24th Annual Day.</p>
                                                                <p>The IOD Distinguished Fellowship Award was conferred
                                                                    on Mr. Baba Kalyani for his distinguished track
                                                                    record of entrepreneurship that has set extremely
                                                                    high standards of ethical and transparent conduct
                                                                    and for Bharat Forge's contribution towards building
                                                                    'Brand India'.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox listScroll">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">27<sup>TH</sup> NOVEMBER 2012</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge conferred Lifetime
                                                                Achievement Award by The Asian Business Leadership Forum
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge was honoured with the much coveted
                                                                    “Lifetime Achievement Award” at the Asian Business
                                                                    Leadership Forum’s award ceremony at Abu Dhabi on
                                                                    27th November 2012.</p>
                                                                <p>The ABLF Lifetime Achievement Award is awarded to
                                                                    people who wield immense influence to mentor a
                                                                    generation of business leaders with old world wisdom
                                                                    and sharp business acumen and who consistently place
                                                                    team, community and country on his/her lead agenda.
                                                                    The ABLF Awards Grand Jury consists of a
                                                                    high-profile group of eminent industry experts,
                                                                    economic commentators and international leaders from
                                                                    government, business, academics, advisory and other
                                                                    professional disciplines.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">07<sup>TH</sup> NOVEMBER 2012</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge conferred "Cross of the
                                                                Order of Merit" by the Federal Republic of Germany</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge was honoured with the “Cross of the
                                                                    Order of Merit” of the Federal Republic of Germany
                                                                    by the German Ambassador to India, His Excellency
                                                                    Mr. Michael Steiner on November 7, 2012 at Mumbai.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p>The 'Cross of the Order of Merit' is Germany's
                                                                    highest honour for exemplary service to the nation
                                                                    awarded to individuals for their admirable services
                                                                    to the Federal Republic of Germany. The recognition
                                                                    is granted to those who make a significant
                                                                    contribution in social, intellectual, economic or
                                                                    political departments.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">17<sup>TH</sup>SEPTEMBER 2012</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge conferred “Doctor of
                                                                Science” by His Excellency Shri Pranab Mukherjee at the
                                                                Annual Convocation of IIT Kharagpur</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge was conferred an Honorary "Doctor of
                                                                    Science" (honoris causa) by His Excellency the
                                                                    President of India Shri Pranab Mukherjee on Saturday
                                                                    at the 58th Annual Convocation of IIT Kharagpur and
                                                                    the culmination of the Diamond Jubilee Celebration
                                                                    of the institute on 17th September 2012.</p>
                                                                <p>The Honorary "Doctor of Science" (honoris causa) was
                                                                    conferred on Mr. Baba Kalyani for his outstanding
                                                                    contribution to Entrepreneurship and for making
                                                                    Bharat Forge a global leader in the forging
                                                                    industry. Also present at the occasion were the
                                                                    Board of Governors and the Senate of IIT Kharagpur.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">05<sup>TH</sup>SEPTEMBER 2013</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">ACMA awards Bharat Forge the Gold
                                                                Trophy for Excellence in Export for the year 2011-12
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Automotive Component Manufacturers Association of
                                                                    India - 'ACMA Awards 2011-12' selected Bharat Forge
                                                                    for the Gold Trophy for Excellence in Export for the
                                                                    year 2011-12.</p>
                                                                <p>The Award was given at the hands of Hon'ble Shri
                                                                    Praful Patel, Union Minister for Ministry of Heavy
                                                                    Industries & Public Enterprises at the ACMA Annual
                                                                    Session on Wednesday, 5th September 2012, at Hotel
                                                                    Taj Palace, Sardar Patel Marg, Delhi.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox listScroll">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">20<sup>TH</sup>DECEMBER 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">EEPC India National Award for
                                                                Export Excellence 2009-2010</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                The EEPC India National Award for Export Excellence
                                                                2009-2010 was awarded to Bharat Forge from Shri.
                                                                Jyotiraditya M Scindia, Hon'ble Minister of State for
                                                                Commerce & Industry, Govt. of India, on 20th December
                                                                2011 at New Delhi and was received by Mr. Lalit Kaul,
                                                                Vice President, Bharat Forge, Delhi office.
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">24<sup>TH</sup> NOVEMBER 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">INS Industrial Excellence Award
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>INS Industrial Excellence Award is given every year
                                                                    to an individual or a group, belonging to the Indian
                                                                    industry that has, during the previous three years,
                                                                    made a significant contribution in the nuclear field
                                                                    through innovative technological and/or management
                                                                    approaches.</p>
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge has been conferred ‘The INS Industrial
                                                                    Excellence Award 2010’ in the inaugural function of
                                                                    Conference on Strategic Electronics at Hyderabad on
                                                                    24th November 2011.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was received by Mr. Sunil Chaturvedi, Chief
                                                                    Operating Officer, Bharat Forge, Capital Goods
                                                                    Division.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">27<sup>TH</sup>AUGUST 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">6th Annual CIO Awards 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>IDG India’s CIO magazine has awarded the ‘CIO100
                                                                    Awards 2011’ to Bharat Forge at the 6th Annual
                                                                    CIO100 awards function held at The Mariott in Pune
                                                                    on August 27th, 2011.</p>
                                                                <p>The annual award program recognizes organizations
                                                                    that exemplify the highest level of operational and
                                                                    strategic excellence in information technology (IT).
                                                                    This year's award theme was "The Creative 100,"
                                                                    which recognized a hundred IT leaders from leading
                                                                    Indian organizations for their creative use of
                                                                    enterprise technologies to meet their organizations’
                                                                    business challenges. In addition to the CIO100
                                                                    Award, Bharat Forge was also conferred with the
                                                                    special award in the ‘Storage Awards 2011’ Category,
                                                                    which came as a surprise at the function.</p>
                                                                <p>The team has won the CIO Award for the second
                                                                    consecutive year.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">23<sup>TH</sup>AUGUST 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Golden Peacock Award for Best HR
                                                                Practices 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was honoured with the Golden Peacock
                                                                    Award for ‘Best HR Practices 2011’ in the
                                                                    Engineering sector. Dr. Santosh Bhave, Vice
                                                                    President HR and Ms. Leena Deshpande, AVP-HR, Bharat
                                                                    Forge received the award from former Chief Justice
                                                                    of India, Justice M.N. Venkatchaliah at a ceremony
                                                                    organized by the Institute of Directors at the Le
                                                                    Meridian, New Delhi recently.</p>
                                                                <p>An eminent panel of judges headed by Dr. Ola Ullsten,
                                                                    Global Chairman & Former Prime Minister of Sweden,
                                                                    Justice P N Bhagwati, Former Chief Justice, Supreme
                                                                    Court of India, Pradeep Chaturvedi, Advisor-FAO and
                                                                    Dr. A N Saksena, Former Financial Advisor, Ministry
                                                                    of Petroleum considered each company’s performance
                                                                    based on a comprehensive set of criteria. The panel
                                                                    evaluated detailed information on the HR practices
                                                                    and systems of participating companies. This year’s
                                                                    format saw major Indian Corporates from 13 different
                                                                    sectors across the country compete for the coveted
                                                                    awards in the final round.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">12<sup>TH</sup>MAY 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">French Distinction - "Chevalier De
                                                                L’ordre De La Légion D’Honneur</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>The French government bestowed the award of Knight of
                                                                    the National Order of the Legion of Honour
                                                                    (Chevalier de l’Ordre de la Légion d’Honneur) on Mr.
                                                                    Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director, Bharat
                                                                    Forge Limited. The Ambassador of France to India,
                                                                    Mr. Jérôme Bonnafont, conferred the distinction on
                                                                    Mr. Baba Kalyani during an award ceremony held at
                                                                    his residence in New Delhi, on 12th May 2011. Baba
                                                                    Kalyani received this award in recognition of his
                                                                    remarkable career as a businessman and his important
                                                                    contribution to enhance the relations between France
                                                                    and India in the economic and commercial fields.</p>
                                                                <p>The “Légion d’Honneur” (Legion of Honour) is the
                                                                    highest distinction that can be conferred by the
                                                                    French Republic on a French Citizen as well as on a
                                                                    foreigner. The Order of the Legion of Honour was
                                                                    instituted in 1802 by Napoléon Bonaparte.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">06<sup>TH</sup>APRIL 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">General Motors as a 2016 Supplier
                                                                of the Year Winner</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was named a GM Supplier of the Year by
                                                                    General Motors during its 25th Annual Supplier of
                                                                    the Year awards ceremony held Friday, March 31 in
                                                                    Orlando, Florida.</p>
                                                                <p>GM recognized 118 of its best suppliers from 15
                                                                    countries that have consistently exceeded GM’s
                                                                    expectations, created outstanding value or brought
                                                                    new innovations to the company. The announcement
                                                                    represented the most suppliers GM has recognized
                                                                    since debuting the Supplier of the Year event in
                                                                    1992. This is the first time Bharat Forge has
                                                                    received the award.</p>
                                                                <p>Winning suppliers were chosen by a global team of GM
                                                                    purchasing, engineering, quality, manufacturing and
                                                                    logistics executives and selected based on
                                                                    performance criteria in Product Purchasing, Indirect
                                                                    Purchasing, Customer Care and Aftersales, and
                                                                    Logistics.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">26<sup>TH</sup>FEBRUARY 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge honoured with the Udyog
                                                                Ratna Award for 2010-11</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge was honoured with the Udyog Ratna Award
                                                                    for 2010-11. The award was conferred on him by the
                                                                    Jagatik Marathi Chamber of Commerce and Industries
                                                                    for his outstanding achievements in the field of
                                                                    Business & Industry.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was presented at the hands of the Hon’ble
                                                                    Chief Minister of Maharashtra, Shri Prithviraj
                                                                    Chavan in the presence of Member of Parliament, Shri
                                                                    Manohar Joshi and Shri Shivajirao Adhalrao Patil on
                                                                    Saturday, 26th February 2011.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">19<sup>TH</sup>FEBRUARY 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">India Shining Star CSR Award</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                Bharat Forge was awarded the prestigious INDIA SHINING
                                                                STAR CSR AWARD for outstanding CSR in the Auto Ancillary
                                                                sector by Wockhardt Foundation. This award was presented
                                                                during ‘CSR Thought Leadership Conclave’ at the hands of
                                                                Shri Salman Khurshid, Honorable Union Cabinet Minister
                                                                for Water Resources and for Minority Affairs on 19th
                                                                February 2011 at Taj Mahal Palace, Colaba, Mumbai.
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">16<sup>TH</sup>JANUARY 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">‘Golden Peacock Innovative Product
                                                                / Service Award – 2011’</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was conferred the prestigious ‘Golden
                                                                    Peacock Innovative Product / Service Award – 2011’
                                                                    at Bangalore in January 2012. The award was given by
                                                                    Mr. Ola Ullsten, former Prime Minister of Sweden and
                                                                    Co-Chair, World Commission on Forests and
                                                                    Sustainable Development and the same was received by
                                                                    BFL Engineering Team.</p>
                                                                <p>Institute of Directors Expert Panel shortlisted 152
                                                                    applications after critical scrutiny for final
                                                                    selection through 3 tier Assessment Process. In
                                                                    Automobile Sector – Bharat Forge was selected as a
                                                                    winner.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was presented at a specially organized
                                                                    ‘Awards Presentation Ceremony’ in the presence of
                                                                    distinguished gathering of business leaders,
                                                                    jurists, academics, environmentalists, economists,
                                                                    legislators and policy makers.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">16<sup>TH</sup>JANUARY 2011</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">ITI Khed awarded Educational
                                                                Excellence Award.</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>The Knowledge Resource Development & Welfare Group
                                                                    (KRDWG) expert panel awarded the Educational
                                                                    Excellence Award to the Khed ITI, supported by
                                                                    Bharat Forge.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was presented by Ms. Chandni Bedi, Head,
                                                                    Navjyoti Foundation and France Parliament member Mr.
                                                                    Pascal to Principal Mr. C. L. Wankhede in a seminar
                                                                    and award ceremony which was scheduled on 21st
                                                                    January, 2012 at IIT Delhi.</p>
                                                                <p>The role model of ITI Khed was selected from 140
                                                                    schools/ITIs across 5 Countries & 17 Indian states.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">21<sup>TH</sup>SEPTEMBER 2010</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing Director, Bharat Forge Decorated with Commander
                                                                First Class of the Royal Order of the Polar Star</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman and Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge was honoured by being decorated with
                                                                    “COMMANDER FIRST CLASS” of the “ROYAL ORDER OF THE
                                                                    POLAR STAR”. The award was presented to him by His
                                                                    Excellency Lars- Olof Lindgren, Swedish Ambassador
                                                                    to India at a special ceremony held at the residence
                                                                    of the Swedish Ambassador in New Delhi.</p>
                                                                <p>The award is in recognition of Mr. Kalyani’s
                                                                    contribution in furthering Trade and Business
                                                                    cooperation between Sweden and India.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">18<sup>TH</sup>FRBRUARY 2010</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">National Award for Best HR
                                                                Practices 2009</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was awarded the National Award for Best
                                                                    HR Practices 2009. The Award and the Winners
                                                                    Certificate was received by Dr. Santosh Bhave & Team
                                                                    during the Annual National Conference of NIPM
                                                                    (National Institute of Personnel Management) at
                                                                    Kolkata on 18th February 2010.</p>
                                                                <p>This was a national level competition organized by
                                                                    NIPM, where several industries from public and
                                                                    private sectors participated. The evaluation process
                                                                    comprised of 4 stages. Application submission,
                                                                    on-site evaluation by eminent Juries, presentation
                                                                    by finalists and 360 degree evaluation by final
                                                                    participant companies.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">14<sup>TH</sup>JUNE 2009</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Golden Peacock Award</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge achieved a remarkable landmark by
                                                                    receiving the prestigious Golden Peacock Award in
                                                                    the field of Occupational Health & Safety. The Award
                                                                    ceremony was held on 14th June 2009 at Palampur in
                                                                    Himachal Pradesh. Mr. K. Kanchan – Head of
                                                                    Occupational Health & Safety received the “Golden
                                                                    Peacock Award” on behalf of Bharat Forge.</p>
                                                                <p>The “Golden Peacock Award” is conferred upon Indian
                                                                    Industries in various categories to encourage &
                                                                    motivate the Industries for achieving excellence.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p>The Institute of Directors thoroughly examined the
                                                                    Health & Safety Management System of various
                                                                    Industries & decided to award Bharat Forge Limited.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">10<sup>TH</sup>MAY 2008</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing
                                                                Director, Bharat Forge honoured with the Prestigious
                                                                "Padma
                                                                Bhushan Award"</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman and Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat
                                                                    Forge was honoured by the Government of India with
                                                                    the
                                                                    prestigious Padma Bhushan Award. This is one of the
                                                                    highest civilian awards in India, conferred upon Mr.
                                                                    Kalyani for his distinguished contributions of high
                                                                    order to Trade and Industry Sector.</p>
                                                                <p>The award is a testimony to his relentless struggle
                                                                    to
                                                                    make Bharat Forge the No. 1 company in the Forging
                                                                    industry in the World. He has heralded the Kalyani
                                                                    Group
                                                                    to new heights of success thus placing India on the
                                                                    World map. The Award was presented to him by the
                                                                    President of India, Ms. Pratibha Patil at
                                                                    Rashtrapati
                                                                    Bhavan in a ceremony held on the 10th of May 2008.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p>The Padma Bhushan award is an Indian civilian
                                                                    decoration
                                                                    established on January 2, 1954 by the President of
                                                                    India. It stands third in the hierarchy of civilian
                                                                    awards, after the Bharat Ratna and the Padma
                                                                    Vibhushan,
                                                                    but comes before the Padma Sri. It is awarded to
                                                                    recognize distinguished service of a high order to
                                                                    the
                                                                    nation, in any field.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox listScroll">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">09<sup>TH</sup>APRIL 2006</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman &
                                                                Managing
                                                                Director, Bharat Forge honoured with the Prestigious
                                                                "Rashtra
                                                                Bhushan Puraskar"</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge
                                                                    was bestowed with the prestigious Rashtra Bhushan
                                                                    Puraskar,
                                                                    an award instituted by the FIE Foundation,
                                                                    Ichalkaranji.</p>
                                                                <p>The award recognizes Mr. Kalyani’s, Outstanding
                                                                    Contribution
                                                                    to Industrial Globalization.</p>
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani received the award at the hands of
                                                                    Chief
                                                                    Minister, Mr. Vilasrao Deshmukh on Sunday, 9th April
                                                                    2006.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p>The function took place at Govindrao High School
                                                                    ground,
                                                                    Ichalkaranji and was presided over by State
                                                                    Cooperatives
                                                                    Minister Patangrao Kadam.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">06<sup>TH</sup>FEBRUARY 2006</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Global Entrepreneur of the Year
                                                                Award</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge
                                                                    was awarded with the Global Entrepreneur of the Year
                                                                    Award
                                                                    by the Jagatik Marathi Chamber of Commerce &
                                                                    Industries.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was presented under the auspices of the
                                                                    Jagatik
                                                                    Marathi Chamber of Commerce & Industries Foundation
                                                                    Day –
                                                                    6th February 2006 at the hands of Mr. Shivraj Patil,
                                                                    Hon’ble
                                                                    Minister for Home Affairs, Government of India. Mr.
                                                                    Vilasrao
                                                                    Deshmukh, Hon’ble Chief Minister of Maharashtra and
                                                                    Dr
                                                                    Raghunath Mashelkar, Director General, CSIR were
                                                                    also
                                                                    present at the occasion. The function was held at
                                                                    the
                                                                    Yashwantrao Chavan Auditorium at Matunga, Mumbai.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p>Since, its inception in 1994 Jagatik Marathi Chamber
                                                                    of
                                                                    Commerce & Industries has endeavoured to reach its
                                                                    objective
                                                                    of progress and prosperity for the Marathi Speaking
                                                                    entrepreneurs across the world.</p>
                                                                <p>It recognizes successful entrepreneurs and awards
                                                                    their
                                                                    achievements in the field of Industry, International
                                                                    Trade,
                                                                    IT, BT, Research, Communication, Hospitality,
                                                                    Education,
                                                                    Health, Agriculture, Tourism, Co-operative and
                                                                    Services
                                                                    sectors.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox listScroll">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">11<sup>TH</sup>NOVEMBER 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">7th Annual Ernst & Young
                                                                Entrepreneur
                                                                of the
                                                                Year Award Manufacturing - 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani received the prestigious
                                                                    international
                                                                    Ernst &
                                                                    Young Entrepreneur of the Year Award – Manufacturing
                                                                    2005.</p>
                                                                <p>As the first award of its kind, Ernst & Young
                                                                    Entrepreneur of the
                                                                    Year recognizes outstanding entrepreneurs who have
                                                                    contributed
                                                                    to nation building and are building & leading
                                                                    dynamic
                                                                    and
                                                                    growing businesses. The Award winners were selected
                                                                    from
                                                                    amongst
                                                                    19 finalists across different categories.</p>
                                                                <p>The Award was received by Mr. Baba Kalyani at the
                                                                    hands
                                                                    of Deputy
                                                                    Chairman, Planning Commission, Mr. Montek Singh
                                                                    Ahluwalia at a
                                                                    function held in Mumbai on 11th November 2005.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">28<sup>TH</sup>SEPTEMBER 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">IGCC Award for the Year 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was conferred with the 'Indo German
                                                                    Chamber
                                                                    of
                                                                    Commerce Award' for outstanding contribution towards
                                                                    the
                                                                    promotion of Indo-German Economic Relations for the
                                                                    year
                                                                    2005.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p>The award was formally handed over to Chairman Mr.
                                                                    Baba
                                                                    Kalyani,
                                                                    on 28th September 2005 at the 49th Annual General
                                                                    Meeting of the
                                                                    Indo German Chamber of Commerce held at Hilton
                                                                    Towers,
                                                                    Mumbai.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">23<sup>TH</sup>APRIL 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">GKD-NIQR Award for ‘Outstanding
                                                                Organization’
                                                                2004</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge received the GKD-NIQR Award for
                                                                    ‘Outstanding
                                                                    Organization’ 2004.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was received by Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman
                                                                    &
                                                                    Managing
                                                                    Director, Bharat Forge, at a function held in
                                                                    Chennai on
                                                                    23rd
                                                                    April 2005.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">04<sup>TH</sup>APRIL 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Best Value Creator Company Award At
                                                                the
                                                                Third
                                                                Annual Outlook Money Awards 2004</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was adjudged as the Best Value Creator
                                                                    among
                                                                    the
                                                                    large companies for 2004, in recognition of their
                                                                    excellence in
                                                                    this category.</p>
                                                                <p>The annual Outlook Money Awards were first instituted
                                                                    in
                                                                    2002 to
                                                                    take note of the achievements of companies in
                                                                    facilitating
                                                                    wealth creation while protecting individuals'
                                                                    interests.
                                                                    The
                                                                    2004 edition of the awards, were given across nine
                                                                    categories
                                                                    which included Best Value Creator Award, Dream Home
                                                                    Award,
                                                                    Wealth Creator Award, Best Insurer Award, Best
                                                                    Banker
                                                                    Award,
                                                                    Best e-Brokerage Award, Best Listing (IPO), Best
                                                                    Merchant Banker
                                                                    and the Hall of Fame Awards.</p>
                                                                <p>The award was received by Mr. Amit B Kalyani,
                                                                    Executive
                                                                    Director,
                                                                    Bharat Forge at the hands of Union Minister for
                                                                    Commerce
                                                                    and
                                                                    Industry, Mr. Kamal Nath at function held in Mumbai
                                                                    on
                                                                    4th April
                                                                    2005.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">24<sup>TH</sup>MARCH 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Business Standard CEO of the Year
                                                                2004
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Mr. Baba Kalyani, Chairman & Managing Director,
                                                                    Bharat
                                                                    Forge was
                                                                    conferred with the Business Standard CEO of the Year
                                                                    2004.</p>
                                                                <p>The criteria for the award was profitable companies
                                                                    with
                                                                    a
                                                                    turnover of Rs. 500 crore and more, while the
                                                                    performance
                                                                    yardsticks were growth, both in terms of sales and
                                                                    profits over
                                                                    the mid-term period for the last three years,
                                                                    efficient
                                                                    use of
                                                                    capital, return to shareholders and prospects of
                                                                    continued
                                                                    growth performance.</p>
                                                                <p>The stress therefore was on sustained and sustainable
                                                                    performance. The award was formally handed over to
                                                                    Mr. B
                                                                    N
                                                                    Kalyani, on 24th March 2005 by the Hon’ble Prime
                                                                    Minister of
                                                                    India, Dr. Manmohan Singh at a function in New
                                                                    Delhi.
                                                                </p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">16<sup>TH</sup>JANUARY 2005</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Forbes ‘Best under a Billion’ list
                                                                for
                                                                the
                                                                third consecutive year</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was included in the Forbes ‘Best under a
                                                                    Billion’
                                                                    list for the third consecutive year.</p>
                                                                <p>Eighteen Indian companies, including software and
                                                                    entertainment
                                                                    giants, made it to the Forbes magazine's list of 200
                                                                    successful
                                                                    companies outside the United States with annual
                                                                    sales of
                                                                    under
                                                                    one billion dollars.</p>
                                                                <p>The magazine specially takes note of the Indian
                                                                    entrepreneurship
                                                                    in the tight world market, pointing out that the
                                                                    number
                                                                    of
                                                                    Indian companies has gone up to 18 this year from 13
                                                                    last year
                                                                    and 10 a year earlier.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="award_contentManibox">
                                                <div class="award_listBox">
                                                    <div class="award_list">
                                                        <div class="award_img">
                                                            <img id="largeImage"
                                                                src="https://www.bharatforge.com/assets/images/about/trophy.png"
                                                                alt="trophy" class="img-fluid" data-aos="zoom-in">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="award_contentBox">
                                                            <div class="award_date">04<sup>TH</sup>NOVEMBER 2004</div>
                                                            <div class="award_title">Forbes ‘Best under a Billion’ list
                                                                for
                                                                the
                                                                second consecutive year</div>
                                                            <div class="award_content">
                                                                <p>Bharat Forge was included in the Forbes ‘Best under a
                                                                    Billion’
                                                                    list for the second consecutive year.</p>
                                                                <p>Published in the November 15th issue of Forbes, the
                                                                    list
                                                                    is
                                                                    compiled from a possible of 2,600 publicly traded
                                                                    companies
                                                                    across Asia Pacific and Europe that had under $1
                                                                    billion
                                                                    a year
                                                                    in revenue and five-year returns on equity of at
                                                                    least
                                                                    5%.</p>
                                                                <p>While, India has the highest number of entries (24)
                                                                    compared to
                                                                    any other nation, except the UK, Bharat Forge was
                                                                    the
                                                                    only auto
                                                                    parts company with an average return on equity of
                                                                    34%
                                                                    (over the
                                                                    five years measured by Forbes) ranking third among
                                                                    the
                                                                    Indian
                                                                    companies on the list.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

